            - removes stale active-border overlays when the focused window closes or hides
            - upgrades the additive IPC protocol to v3
            - includes upstream clap 4.6.6 and thiserror 2.0.20 patch updates

            Distribution:
            - portable ZIP and individual executables
            - validated per-machine MSI with Start Menu shortcuts, PATH integration, ARP icon,
              un